{
  "brief_rationale": "Trajectory fully satisfied all 7 responsibility-chain items with no serious or minor error. The doctor actively triggered and completed HO2 (verification of ANA/anti-phospholipid ambiguity) and HO4 (bounded closure with residual risk classification), each supported by distinct beyond-minimum actions. No important non-chain defect was present and closure was safely executable, traceable, and valid. Therefore the grade is 5 Perfect.",
