        "event_id": "lite_evt_00147",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly bounds what requires immediate reporting versus what can wait for in-person review, and confirms patient understanding of residual risks and follow-up plan.",
        "quote": "不需要每一份结果都马上跑来找我念。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00147",
        "explanation": "Patient demonstrates receipt and confirms the action plan, drug handling, and follow-up, meeting safe closure criteria.",
