      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor provided a specific, time-bound, and owner-assigned action plan (drugs stopped/saved, 2-week obstetric follow-up, what symptoms trigger emergency, what results require urgent reporting). Patient confirmed understanding and took concrete steps (saved drugs, booked appointment). All remaining uncertainties were safely classified as deferred to in-person review.",
