        "quote": "产后常规复查：一般引产后大概 2 到 6 周，你先挂产科/计划生育科"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
        "explanation": "Doctor reasons that low-titer ANA alone is not diagnostic, identifies missing anti-phospholipid tests, and plans to verify via system query and patient recall.",
        "quote": "“1:100 阳性”这个值，在临床上属于低滴度阳性，单独拿出来意义不大。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00122",
