        "quote": "先不要自己重新把肝素打起来，也不要自己吃阿司匹林。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00122",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a family-ready, non-technical script for the patient to use about not restarting medication and deferring fertility conclusions.",
        "quote": "你可以直接告诉他们：医生说了，这次出院没让继续用，现在就停着"
      }
    ]
  },
