          "quote": "如果弹出的是跟抗磷脂抗体相关的那几个项目...你不管有没有不舒服，都要立刻把报告上的项目全名和数值一字一句念给我听"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered because the episode had many residual uncertainties (genetic recurrence, ANA meaning, thyroid/肌瘤 management). The doctor built a clear, multi-tier 'what to do now vs. what must wait for clinic' boundary, explicitly linking anti-phospholipid results to a different urgency tier. This is beyond a simple teach-back; it is a structured risk-tiered closure.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
