          "quote": "先不要自己重新把肝素打起来，也不要自己吃阿司匹林。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor safely addressed the patient's confusion about heparin and aspirin, clearly stating they should not be self-administered, and later also addressed the different management needed for thyroid medication (not to be stopped without doctor advice).",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_medication_safety",
      "status": "met"
