          "quote": "产后常规复查：一般引产后大概 2 到 6 周，你先挂产科/计划生育科，主要看子宫恢复...顺便把这次引产住院里没查全的免疫和甲状腺项目一起开单。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provided a clear, executable, and owner-assigned action plan with specific timing and a rationale for what to bring, satisfying the requirement for more than just a vague follow-up recommendation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_action_plan_owner_timing",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
